[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744551071","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403#issuecomment-4744551071","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120403","id":4744551071,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGswanw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T17:32:59Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T17:32:59Z","body":"> With this PR, saving and loading of folding will now align with the saving and loading timings of Animations or scenes.\r\n\r\nWhat if someone changes folding and closes the scene without saving (since there is no changes)?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744551071/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746914355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403#issuecomment-4746914355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120403","id":4746914355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGvAqMw","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T23:17:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T23:17:57Z","body":"> What if someone changes folding and closes the scene without saving (since there is no changes)?\r\n\r\nThe state will be discarded so it's a trade-off, but since it means they haven't saved their animation edits, I think this is the expected behavior.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746914355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746963818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403#issuecomment-4746963818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120403","id":4746963818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGvDrag","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T23:28:56Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T10:23:28Z","body":"If we're going this route, I'd just make folding be part of the edit state. I had this idea for some time, but didn't implement it, because folding is supposed to be saved more often. I might try it out now I guess.\r\nEDIT:\r\nNevermind, editstate is for scenes only.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746963818/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771002937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403#issuecomment-4771002937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120403","id":4771002937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHF-6OQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T17:23:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T17:31:04Z","body":"Tested this PR, sadly it doesn't solve the regression for me on Dogwalk.\r\n\r\nRenaming the main scene takes 25s in the test I just did with this PR (local `production=yes` build for Linux). With 4.7-stable, it takes 22s. I can't say whether the difference is signative, it's a build with a different compiler and slightly different options, but both production/LTO.\r\n\r\nThe code changes look good overall, so it might still be worth merging if it solves other scenarios, but we need to keep the issue open or have another one to track the remaining regression.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771002937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4774027310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403#issuecomment-4774027310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120403","id":4774027310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHI3gLg","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T23:19:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T23:19:24Z","body":"Made changes to LocalVector allocation and reduced the number of iterations. This should now make it as fast as version 4.6.\r\n\r\nRegarding the behavior of EditableChildren with AnimationPlayers: Previously, the fold state was saved for each scene depending on the frequency of save/load operations, but since I’ve reduced the number of save/load operations, a guard check is now required. This guard should ensure that the behavior of saving the fold state for each scene is preserved.\r\n\r\nIf you switch scenes while the AnimationPlayerEditor is open, there is an issue the view will display the state of the previous scene. However, since this is an issue that existed prior to this fix, it is unrelated to this PR. I think we'll be able to follow up on this consistency later. cc @Meorge","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4774027310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4778975973","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403#issuecomment-4778975973","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120403","id":4778975973,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHNli5Q","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T12:02:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T12:02:28Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4778975973/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4779986545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403#issuecomment-4779986545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120